 kind of ritual or enchantment to make sure that if you\u2019re a sidhe lady and you have a baby that your daughter or your son will be sidhe too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-26T15:43:11-07:00","id":1399149,"title":"","content":"Oh I definitely agree No One of Consequence that such a feudal model would be extremely interesting to explore through CtD and I think that there were glimmers of this in how changeling presented things but that could have definitely been more highlighted.<br /> <br /> The vast spectrum of societies and social groups and experiences and motifs that manifest within Changeling society is what I think is probably some of the most interesting parts of the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}